{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32607","headline":"经麻姑山 · 刘沧","name":"经麻姑山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"麻姑此地链神丹，寂寞烟霞古竈残。\n一自仙娥归碧落，几年春雨洗红兰。\n帆飞震泽秋江远，雨过陵阳晚树寒。\n山顶白云千万片，时闻鸾鹤下仙坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘沧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32607.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32607","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}